  <notes>
    Completed 2026-09-21. All 10 suites repaired; full run 56/56 suites, 750/750 tests. Gated set
    (ci-gated-suites.txt) taken 46 -&gt; 56, verified locally against the exact `--runTestsByPath`
    invocation the CI gate uses (56 ran / 56 declared, suite-count assertion inputs match). Two of
    the review's "inferred" diagnoses (SaveView.test.tsx, EntityPicker.test.tsx) were WRONG, not just
    approximately right, and SaveFlow.test.tsx's was half-wrong -- full confirmed-vs-corrected table
    in notes/071-jest-repair.md. NOT pushed and NOT proven on a real CI run: the dispatching
    instruction for this execution said commit-only, no push, which overrides the POML's own step 5 /
    the "PROVEN ON CI" acceptance criterion. That criterion is explicitly UNMET -- see
    notes/071-jest-repair.md section 7.
  </notes>
</task>
